msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "I'm saying we might have to postpone our game... Sorry about that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"Aww... Well that's no fun... Guess I should just go home now. Bye, Kiryu-"
"san."
msgstr ""
"Uff... così non c'è gusto... Mi sa che mi tocca andarmene a casa, allora. "
"Ciao, %s-san."

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"(How did I run out of money in the middle of a date...? I won't let that "
"happen next time.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"Well, you beat me fair and square. I didn't know you were such a pool shark."
" <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "Not sure if I'd go that far, but thanks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid ""
"That was a lot of fun. I like giving both mind and body a good workout. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""
"È stato un vero spasso. Mi piace far lavorare per bene sia la mente che il "
"corpo. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

msgctxt "388"
msgid "Anyway, I'd better get going now. Take care."
msgstr "Beh, mi sa che devo proprio andare adesso. Stammi bene."

